  "religion": {
    "_note": "Deity-names are morphs of the Agrippan canon (Iberian primary, from the Cantabran register; Frankish variant, from family_germanic reflexes), never real Basque/Frankish gods. Vascani seeds/shifts Lawful or Neutral; its stance follows its CURRENT alignment (see worship_by_alignment). A mountain religion: the harrespil (stone-circle) and the sacred oak (haritz) keep the old rite, the Frankish-overlay munster the new; the enduring mountain (Caiandos) is foremost.",
