      "1": "Aruspex (diviner-acolyte)",
      "3": "Sacron (priest)",
      "5": "Gutuater (high priest)",
      "7": "Phaffo (Frankish minster-priest, overlay)",
      "9": "Ard-drux (arch-druid)"
    },
    "demon_epithet_pattern": "the demonized set (the Chaotic powers, when Lawful) take dread epithets: Maraxus -> Maraxos the Burning; Vacidus -> Bacaid the Unmaker; Lusanto -> Losand the Hoard-Worm.",
