    "_tiers_note": "Basque-Vasconian ladder, ascending, with a Frankish feudal overlay on the marches. Jauntxo (petty-lord) barony; Markigravo (Frankish margrave) march, over a Marka; Gravo (Frankish count) county, over a Konderri; Herizogo (Frankish duke) duchy; Jaun Nagusi (Basque great-lord) principality; Errege (king) kingdom; Errege Nagusi (high-king) over the realm. The Frankish crown often claims overlordship of the march. (Rank titles are the real Basque/Frankish register, allowed.)",
